{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/04/5053957/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/04/5053957/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/04/5053957/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はパシフィコ横浜で\nハルジオンが咲く頃の最後の個別握手会が\nありました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方が会いに来てくださり\nたくさんの方とお話ができ\nとても楽しく幸せな時間でした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15枚目の握手会も\nよろしくお願いします♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、受験勉強で来れなくなる。。。\nという方もちらほら。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校生が受験勉強を本気でやることも\n一生の中に本番までの何カ月だけかもしれないから、頑張ってください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援しています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にもいろいろな事情で\n来られなくなってしまう方もいましたが\n私はいつでも応援しています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかまた会えるように\nお互いがんばろうね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/04/5053957/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},